Scope of Project Euler material in this repository
--------------------------------------------------

No Project Euler problem statements are distributed with this replication package.
They were retrieved locally at study time and are excluded from distribution. To
rebuild the corpus from source, run the retrieval script:

    cd geminiflash3model
    ./mvnw -q compile exec:java \
        -Dexec.mainClass=com.comparisonai.geminiflash3.utils.DownloadQuestions

This writes problems/<n>.txt for n = 1..1007 from https://projecteuler.net/minimal=<n>,
rate-limited to one request every 200 ms. The retrieval script itself is MIT-licensed
and is the author's own work.

The published Project Euler answers are likewise not distributed. Correctness scoring
is reproduced from tools/answers.sha256.json, which contains only the SHA-256 digest
of each canonical answer string. See tools/verify_answer.py.

The LLM-generated Java files in this repository contain single-line, model-written
restatements of each problem's task, in the form:

    // Problem: Find the sum of all the multiples of 3 or 5 below 1000

These were produced by the language models under study, not transcribed by the author,
and are retained unmodified because the generated files are the primary research
artefact and altering them would invalidate the reported results. They are disclosed
here for completeness.


